# Line endings: every checkout gets the committed bytes, LF, on every platform
# (including Windows with core.autocrlf=true). The API snapshot, JSON profile
# goldens, the generated crypto/tls mirror and upstream/utls.patch are compared
# byte for byte, and Go sources are gofmt'ed with LF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Byte-exact fixtures are never converted.
*.png binary
*.pem -text
*.hex -text
internal/tls/testdata/** -text
upstream/utls.patch -text
